"Upgrade wallet" = "Nadgradi denarnico";
"Upgrade your wallet" = "Nadgradi svojo denarnico";
"This version moves your wallet to a safer storage format. It only takes a moment." = "Ta različica premakne tvojo denarnico v varnejšo obliko shranjevanja. Traja le trenutek.";
"Your original keys are not deleted or replaced" = "Tvoji prvotni ključi ne bodo izbrisani ali zamenjani";
"If a check fails, SORA stops safely and shows your options" = "Če preverjanje ne uspe, se SORA varno ustavi in prikaže možnosti";
"What happens during the upgrade?" = "Kaj se zgodi med nadgradnjo?";
"SORA found a wallet created by an older app version." = "SORA je našla denarnico, ustvarjeno s starejšo različico aplikacije.";
"SORA checks the recovery data saved by the older version, derives the same SORA account from it, and saves that account in a way that survives interruptions." = "SORA preveri obnovitvene podatke, ki jih je shranila starejša različica, iz njih izpelje isti račun SORA in ga shrani na način, odporen proti prekinitvam.";
"The original Keychain entry is not deleted or replaced in this release. If any check fails, SORA stops and shows your recovery options instead of creating another wallet." = "Prvotni vnos v Obesku za ključe v tej izdaji ni izbrisan ali zamenjan. Če katero koli preverjanje ne uspe, se SORA ustavi in prikaže možnosti obnove, namesto da bi ustvarila drugo denarnico.";
"Updating your wallet. Keep SORA open until this finishes." = "Posodabljanje denarnice. SORA naj ostane odprta, dokler se to ne konča.";
"We paused to keep your wallet safe" = "Začasno smo se ustavili, da zaščitimo tvojo denarnico";
"Copy recovery details" = "Kopiraj podrobnosti obnove";
"Create protected recovery export" = "Ustvari zaščiten izvoz za obnovo";
"Recovery export help" = "Pomoč za izvoz za obnovo";
"Free up some space" = "Sprosti nekaj prostora";
"Free up some storage on this iPhone, then check again. Your accounts and keys have not been changed." = "Sprosti nekaj prostora na tem iPhonu in znova preveri. Tvoji računi in ključi niso bili spremenjeni.";
"Check again" = "Preveri znova";
"Set aside unfinished transaction records" = "Odloži zapise nedokončanih transakcij";
"Set aside unfinished transaction records?" = "Odložiti zapise nedokončanih transakcij?";
"SORA will move its records of transactions that were still being confirmed to a separate folder on this iPhone. Nothing is deleted, and your accounts, keys and funds are not changed. SORA will no longer be able to tell you whether your most recent transaction went through, so check your activity before you send it again." = "SORA bo svoje zapise transakcij, ki so še čakale na potrditev, premaknila v ločeno mapo na tem iPhonu. Nič ne bo izbrisano, tvoji računi, ključi in sredstva pa se ne spremenijo. SORA ne bo več mogla povedati, ali je bila tvoja najnovejša transakcija izvedena, zato preveri dejavnost, preden jo znova pošlješ.";
"Set aside" = "Odloži";
"Could not set the records aside" = "Zapisov ni bilo mogoče odložiti";
"SORA cannot read its records of transactions that were still being confirmed, so it cannot safely start a new one. Your accounts, keys and funds are not affected. You can set these records aside below. Nothing is deleted." = "SORA ne more prebrati zapisov transakcij, ki so še čakale na potrditev, zato ne more varno začeti nove. Tvoji računi, ključi in sredstva niso prizadeti. Te zapise lahko odložiš spodaj. Nič ne bo izbrisano.";
"If setting the records aside does not help, contact SORA support with the app version shown below. Never share your recovery phrase." = "Če odložitev zapisov ne pomaga, se obrni na podporo SORA in navedi spodaj prikazano različico aplikacije. Nikoli ne deli obnovitvene fraze.";
"SORA also cannot read its records of transactions that were still being confirmed. You can set these records aside below. Nothing is deleted." = "SORA tudi ne more prebrati zapisov transakcij, ki so še čakale na potrditev. Te zapise lahko odložiš spodaj. Nič ne bo izbrisano.";
"SORA could not read its records of transactions that were still being confirmed when it last checked. Your accounts, keys and funds are not affected." = "Ob zadnjem preverjanju SORA ni mogla prebrati zapisov transakcij, ki so še čakale na potrditev. Tvoji računi, ključi in sredstva niso prizadeti.";
"Try again. If this screen appears again, contact SORA support with the app version shown below. Never share your recovery phrase." = "Poskusi znova. Če se ta zaslon znova prikaže, se obrni na podporo SORA in navedi spodaj prikazano različico aplikacije. Nikoli ne deli obnovitvene fraze.";
"Enter your current app PIN to change it." = "Za spremembo vnesi trenutni PIN aplikacije.";
"PIN not changed" = "PIN ni bil spremenjen";
"Enter the current app PIN to authorize this change." = "Za odobritev te spremembe vnesi trenutni PIN aplikacije.";
"Enter a valid PIN." = "Vnesi veljaven PIN.";
"The PIN update could not be completed. Try again. Your wallet keys are unchanged." = "Posodobitve PIN-a ni bilo mogoče dokončati. Poskusi znova. Ključi tvoje denarnice so nespremenjeni.";
"These wallets have no saved ownership PIN. Restore them with your recovery phrase or Google Drive backup." = "Te denarnice nimajo shranjenega lastniškega PIN-a. Obnovi jih z obnovitveno frazo ali varnostno kopijo v Google Drive.";
"Enter the PIN that protected these wallets. Only wallets owned by that PIN will be restored, and this app will use that PIN." = "Vnesi PIN, ki je ščitil te denarnice. Obnovljene bodo samo denarnice, ki pripadajo temu PIN-u, in aplikacija bo uporabljala ta PIN.";
"Enter the PIN that protected the wallets you want to restore." = "Vnesi PIN, ki je ščitil denarnice, ki jih želiš obnoviti.";
"Enter this app's PIN. The restored wallets will from now on be protected by this app's PIN." = "Vnesi PIN te aplikacije. Obnovljene denarnice bo odslej ščitil PIN te aplikacije.";
"We found SORA data from an earlier install on this iPhone. Choose how to continue. Nothing will be deleted. Wallets saved by older versions without an ownership PIN need your recovery phrase or Google Drive backup." = "Na tem iPhonu smo našli podatke SORA iz prejšnje namestitve. Izberi, kako želiš nadaljevati. Nič ne bo izbrisano. Denarnice, shranjene s starejšimi različicami brez lastniškega PIN-a, potrebujejo obnovitveno frazo ali varnostno kopijo v Google Drive.";
"SORA will start fresh on this iPhone. Wallet keys saved on this iPhone are not deleted, and the earlier wallet data is moved to a separate folder on this iPhone. You can restore any wallet with its recovery phrase or Google Drive backup. Wallets with a saved ownership PIN can also be restored with that PIN." = "SORA bo na tem iPhonu začela znova. Shranjeni ključi denarnic ne bodo izbrisani, prejšnji podatki pa bodo premaknjeni v ločeno mapo na tem iPhonu. Vsako denarnico lahko obnoviš z njeno obnovitveno frazo ali varnostno kopijo v Google Drive. Denarnice s shranjenim lastniškim PIN-om lahko obnoviš tudi s tem PIN-om.";
"SORA will start fresh on this iPhone. Wallet keys saved on this iPhone are not deleted. You can restore any wallet later with its recovery phrase or Google Drive backup. Wallets with a saved ownership PIN can also be restored from Add account with that PIN." = "SORA bo na tem iPhonu začela znova. Shranjeni ključi denarnic ne bodo izbrisani. Vsako denarnico lahko pozneje obnoviš z njeno obnovitveno frazo ali varnostno kopijo v Google Drive. Denarnice s shranjenim lastniškim PIN-om lahko obnoviš tudi prek Dodaj račun s tem PIN-om.";
"Restore a historical wallet" = "Obnovi staro denarnico";
"For a 3-, 6-, or 9-word phrase, enter the SORA address of the wallet you want to restore. The phrase and derivation path must match this address before any keys are saved." = "Pri frazi s 3, 6 ali 9 besedami vnesi naslov SORA denarnice, ki jo želiš obnoviti. Fraza in pot izpeljave se morata ujemati s tem naslovom, preden se shrani kateri koli ključ.";
"SORA wallet address" = "Naslov denarnice SORA";
"Advanced options" = "Napredne možnosti";
"Key type" = "Vrsta ključa";
"Derivation path (optional)" = "Pot izpeljave (neobvezno)";
"Backup file password" = "Geslo datoteke varnostne kopije";
"Complete PIN setup" = "Dokončaj nastavitev PIN-a";
"Your restored wallets are saved. Complete PIN setup to continue. Your wallet keys are unchanged." = "Obnovljene denarnice so shranjene. Za nadaljevanje dokončaj nastavitev PIN-a. Ključi denarnic so nespremenjeni.";
"Your restored wallets are saved, but the PIN protection update could not finish. Try again before using them." = "Obnovljene denarnice so shranjene, vendar posodobitve zaščite s PIN-om ni bilo mogoče dokončati. Poskusi znova, preden jih uporabiš.";
"Wallet restore" = "Obnova denarnice";
"A protected recovery export contains public wallet metadata but no phrase, seed, private key, PIN, signed payload, or Keychain item." = "Zaščiten izvoz za obnovo vsebuje javne metapodatke denarnice, ne pa fraze, semena, zasebnega ključa, PIN-a, podpisane vsebine ali vnosa iz Obeska za ključe.";
"App PIN" = "PIN aplikacije";
"Backup password" = "Geslo varnostne kopije";
"Choose the app PIN for the returned wallets. Their files will move back, their keys will stay on this iPhone, and SORA will check them before opening. From now on, these wallets will use this PIN." = "Izberi PIN aplikacije za vrnjene denarnice. Njihove datoteke bodo premaknjene nazaj, ključi ostanejo na tem iPhonu, SORA pa jih pred odprtjem preveri. Odslej bodo te denarnice uporabljale ta PIN.";
"Choose the existing wallet" = "Izberi obstoječo denarnico";
"Choose the saved wallet data to check. Your current wallet must be empty." = "Izberi shranjene podatke denarnice za preverjanje. Tvoja trenutna denarnica mora biti prazna.";
"Choose the saved wallet whose keys you want to restore." = "Izberi shranjeno denarnico, katere ključe želiš obnoviti.";
"Confirm app PIN" = "Potrdi PIN aplikacije";
"Contact SORA support if you need help. Never share your recovery phrase, private key or PIN." = "Če potrebuješ pomoč, se obrni na podporo SORA. Nikoli ne deli obnovitvene fraze, zasebnega ključa ali PIN-a.";
"Copy instructions" = "Kopiraj navodila";
"Could not prepare wallet setup" = "Nastavitve denarnice ni bilo mogoče pripraviti";
"Create export" = "Ustvari izvoz";
"Create protected recovery export?" = "Ustvariti zaščiten izvoz za obnovo?";
"Earlier wallet data not opened" = "Prejšnji podatki denarnice niso odprti";
"Encrypted backup found. Enter its backup password to verify and restore the saved account." = "Najdena je šifrirana varnostna kopija. Vnesi njeno geslo za preverjanje in obnovo shranjenega računa.";
"Enter the PIN that protected these wallets. If they used different PINs, you will be asked for each one." = "Vnesi PIN, ki je ščitil te denarnice. Če so uporabljale različne PIN-e, boš moral vnesti vsakega posebej.";
"Enter the password you set for this SORA Google Drive backup. The password stays on this iPhone. SORA will verify that the backup matches your saved account before restoring missing keys." = "Vnesi geslo, ki si ga določil za to varnostno kopijo SORA v Google Drive. Geslo ostane na tem iPhonu. SORA bo pred obnovo manjkajočih ključev preverila, ali se kopija ujema s shranjenim računom.";
"Enter this wallet’s recovery phrase on this iPhone. It must match the existing account. Add your original derivation path only if you used one." = "Na tem iPhonu vnesi obnovitveno frazo te denarnice. Ujemati se mora z obstoječim računom. Prvotno pot izpeljave dodaj le, če si jo uporabljal.";
"It does not contain your phrase, seed, private key, PIN, signed transaction payloads, or any Keychain item. Keychain secrets stay only on this device." = "Ne vsebuje tvoje fraze, semena, zasebnega ključa, PIN-a, podpisanih vsebin transakcij ali katerega koli vnosa iz Obeska za ključe. Skrivnosti Obeska za ključe ostanejo samo na tej napravi.";
"Keep any existing recovery phrase or encrypted JSON backup offline." = "Obstoječo obnovitveno frazo ali šifrirano varnostno kopijo JSON hrani brez povezave.";
"Keep the export private and share it only through an official support channel whose identity you have verified." = "Izvoz ohrani zaseben in ga deli samo prek uradnega kanala podpore, katerega pristnost si preveril.";
"Keychain secrets remain only on this device." = "Skrivnosti Obeska za ključe ostanejo samo na tej napravi.";
"Keychain secrets stay only on this device." = "Skrivnosti Obeska za ključe se hranijo samo na tej napravi.";
"Missing credentials restored. Verifying the complete wallet…" = "Manjkajoče poverilnice so obnovljene. Preverjanje celotne denarnice…";
"Never send anyone your phrase, seed, private key, or PIN." = "Nikomur nikoli ne pošiljaj fraze, semena, zasebnega ključa ali PIN-a.";
"No detailed check was recorded by the previous build." = "Prejšnja izdaja ni zabeležila podrobnega preverjanja.";
"No recovery package was published." = "Objavljen ni bil noben obnovitveni paket.";
"Open SORA support" = "Odpri podporo SORA";
"Original derivation path (optional)" = "Prvotna pot izpeljave (neobvezno)";
"Protect the returned wallets" = "Zaščiti vrnjene denarnice";
"Protect your recovery options" = "Zaščiti svoje možnosti obnove";
"Protected export created." = "Zaščiten izvoz je ustvarjen.";
"Recovery export stopped safely" = "Izvoz za obnovo se je varno ustavil";
"Recovery phrase" = "Obnovitvena fraza";
"Restore with your recovery phrase using the button below." = "Obnovi s svojo obnovitveno frazo z uporabo spodnjega gumba.";
"SORA could not prepare the new wallet setup. The earlier wallet keys and their ownership PIN protection are unchanged. Try again, or restore the wallets first." = "SORA ni mogla pripraviti nastavitve nove denarnice. Prejšnji ključi denarnic in njihova zaščita z lastniškim PIN-om so nespremenjeni. Poskusi znova ali najprej obnovi denarnice.";
"SORA could not verify the wallet for this operation. Your existing wallet data has been kept." = "SORA ni mogla preveriti denarnice za to dejanje. Obstoječi podatki denarnice so ohranjeni.";
"Saved wallet data %d" = "Shranjeni podatki denarnice %d";
"Set up this iPhone again keeps the earlier files in a separate folder on this iPhone." = "Ponovna nastavitev tega iPhona ohrani prejšnje datoteke v ločeni mapi na tem iPhonu.";
"Sign in to the Google account used for this wallet’s backup. SORA will read its encrypted backup." = "Prijavi se v račun Google, uporabljen za varnostno kopijo te denarnice. SORA bo prebrala njegovo šifrirano kopijo.";
"The earlier data could not be returned safely. Its files and keys have been kept. Reopen SORA to resume an interrupted return, or restore with your original backup." = "Prejšnjih podatkov ni bilo mogoče varno vrniti. Njihove datoteke in ključi so ohranjeni. Znova odpri SORA za nadaljevanje prekinjenega vračanja ali obnovi s prvotno varnostno kopijo.";
"The earlier files were kept. Reopen SORA to continue, or try again." = "Prejšnje datoteke so ohranjene. Znova odpri SORA za nadaljevanje ali poskusi znova.";
"The export can contain public wallet metadata, including addresses, account names, preferences, and transaction history." = "Izvoz lahko vsebuje javne metapodatke denarnice, vključno z naslovi, imeni računov, nastavitvami in zgodovino transakcij.";
"The installed wallet, settings, recovery marker, and Keychain were not changed." = "Nameščena denarnica, nastavitve, oznaka obnove in Obesek za ključe niso bili spremenjeni.";
"The phrase and derivation path could not be verified for this account, or the keys could not be saved. Existing accounts and keys were not replaced. Check your original backup and try again." = "Fraze in poti izpeljave za ta račun ni bilo mogoče preveriti ali pa ključev ni bilo mogoče shraniti. Obstoječi računi in ključi niso bili zamenjani. Preveri prvotno varnostno kopijo in poskusi znova.";
"The retained account could not be read for recovery. Its data has not been changed." = "Ohranjenega računa ni bilo mogoče prebrati za obnovo. Njegovi podatki niso bili spremenjeni.";
"These wallets were saved by an older version without an ownership PIN. Restore them with their recovery phrase or Google Drive backup. The earlier files and keys remain on this iPhone." = "Te denarnice so bile shranjene s starejšo različico brez lastniškega PIN-a. Obnovi jih z njihovo obnovitveno frazo ali varnostno kopijo v Google Drive. Prejšnje datoteke in ključi ostanejo na tem iPhonu.";
"Try again to run the wallet checks once more." = "Poskusi znova, da se preverjanja denarnice ponovijo.";
"Unlock this iPhone, then try again." = "Odkleni ta iPhone in poskusi znova.";
"Unlock your existing backup" = "Odkleni obstoječo varnostno kopijo";
"Use Copy recovery details when contacting SORA support." = "Pri stiku s podporo SORA uporabi Kopiraj podrobnosti obnove.";
"Use earlier wallet data" = "Uporabi prejšnje podatke denarnice";
"Use the earlier wallet data again" = "Znova uporabi prejšnje podatke denarnice";
"Verify and restore" = "Preveri in obnovi";
"Verifying preserved files. Wallet data and Keychain will not be changed." = "Preverjanje ohranjenih datotek. Podatki denarnice in Obesek za ključe ne bodo spremenjeni.";
"Verifying the backup against the saved account…" = "Preverjanje varnostne kopije glede na shranjeni račun…";
"Wallet keys not restored" = "Ključi denarnice niso obnovljeni";
"You can also restore from your encrypted Google Drive backup." = "Obnoviš lahko tudi iz šifrirane varnostne kopije v Google Drive.";
"You can set aside the unreadable records of unfinished transactions below. Your wallet keys will not change." = "Spodaj lahko odložiš neberljive zapise nedokončanih transakcij. Ključi tvoje denarnice se ne bodo spremenili.";
"Available" = "Na voljo";
"Backup recovery: %@" = "Obnova varnostne kopije: %@";
"Confirm the repair before changing this wallet's credentials." = "Pred spremembo poverilnic te denarnice potrdi popravilo.";
"Confirm wallet repair" = "Potrdi popravilo denarnice";
"Current app PIN" = "Trenutni PIN aplikacije";
"Current failure: %@" = "Trenutna napaka: %@";
"Enter the current app PIN to restore the downloaded backup for this account." = "Vnesi trenutni PIN aplikacije za obnovo prenesene varnostne kopije za ta račun.";
"Enter the recovery phrase, raw seed, or JSON backup that restores this exact wallet address." = "Vnesi obnovitveno frazo, surovo seme ali varnostno kopijo JSON, ki obnovi natančno ta naslov denarnice.";
"Google Drive" = "Google Drive";
"JSON backup password" = "Geslo varnostne kopije JSON";
"Latest verification: not recorded; retry required" = "Zadnje preverjanje: ni zabeleženo; potreben je ponovni poskus";
"Original recovery trigger: %@" = "Prvotni razlog za obnovo: %@";
"Original recovery trigger: legacy record (details unavailable)" = "Prvotni razlog za obnovo: stari zapis (podrobnosti niso na voljo)";
"Protected data when copied: %@" = "Zaščita podatkov ob kopiranju: %@";
"Raw seed" = "Surovo seme";
"Recovery phrase, raw seed, or JSON backup" = "Obnovitvena fraza, surovo seme ali varnostna kopija JSON";
"Recovery report format: 2" = "Oblika poročila o obnovi: 2";
"Repair wallet" = "Popravi denarnico";
"Repair wallet credentials" = "Popravi poverilnice denarnice";
"Retry repair" = "Znova poskusi popravilo";
"Review repair" = "Preglej popravilo";
"Supply a backup for the address below. Failed credentials will be preserved on this iPhone before replacement. This wallet will use the current app PIN." = "Priskrbi varnostno kopijo za spodnji naslov. Neuspešne poverilnice bodo pred zamenjavo ohranjene na tem iPhonu. Ta denarnica bo uporabljala trenutni PIN aplikacije.";
"The backup could not be verified or the repair could not finish. Check the backup and PIN, then try again. Preserved credentials are unchanged." = "Varnostne kopije ni bilo mogoče preveriti ali popravila ni bilo mogoče dokončati. Preveri kopijo in PIN ter poskusi znova. Ohranjene poverilnice so nespremenjene.";
"The repair could not be completed. Preserved credentials remain on this iPhone. Retry the repair before using this wallet." = "Popravila ni bilo mogoče dokončati. Ohranjene poverilnice ostanejo na tem iPhonu. Pred uporabo te denarnice znova poskusi popravilo.";
"The supplied backup must restore this exact address. Failed credentials will be preserved before replacement, and this wallet will use the current app PIN." = "Priskrbljena varnostna kopija mora obnoviti natančno ta naslov. Neuspešne poverilnice bodo pred zamenjavo ohranjene, ta denarnica pa bo uporabljala trenutni PIN aplikacije.";
"This wallet cannot be repaired in its current state. Return to recovery and try again." = "Te denarnice v trenutnem stanju ni mogoče popraviti. Vrni se k obnovi in poskusi znova.";
"Unavailable" = "Ni na voljo";
"Unknown" = "Neznano";
"Verifying and preserving wallet credentials…" = "Preverjanje in ohranjanje poverilnic denarnice…";
"Wallet credentials repaired." = "Poverilnice denarnice so popravljene.";
"The retained migration manifest does not identify signing material for this account. This check did not establish that its Keychain records are absent. Existing account data has been preserved." = "Ohranjeni manifest selitve ne določa gradiva za podpisovanje za ta račun. To preverjanje ni ugotovilo, da njegovi zapisi v Obesku za ključe manjkajo. Obstoječi podatki računa so ohranjeni.";
"SORA found your saved account, but could not find matching signing material through the permitted Keychain lookups. This does not prove a key was deleted. If you have the original recovery phrase, use Restore existing wallet keys to restore this same account." = "SORA je našla shranjeni račun, vendar z dovoljenimi poizvedbami v Obesku za ključe ni našla ustreznega gradiva za podpisovanje. To ne dokazuje, da je bil ključ izbrisan. Če imaš prvotno obnovitveno frazo, uporabi Obnovi ključe obstoječe denarnice za obnovo tega istega računa.";
"A matching wallet key record was found, but it was empty. Existing account data and other keys have been preserved." = "Najden je bil ustrezen zapis ključa denarnice, vendar je bil prazen. Obstoječi podatki računa in drugi ključi so ohranjeni.";
"iOS did not allow SORA to read the protected Keychain. Unlock this iPhone, then try again." = "iOS aplikaciji SORA ni dovolil branja zaščitenega Obeska za ključe. Odkleni ta iPhone in poskusi znova.";
"iOS rejected this app’s Keychain access. The error details include the system status; no wallet data was replaced." = "iOS je zavrnil dostop te aplikacije do Obeska za ključe. Podrobnosti napake vsebujejo stanje sistema; nobeni podatki denarnice niso bili zamenjani.";
"iOS returned an error while SORA was checking a wallet key. No missing-key conclusion was made for that failed operation." = "iOS je vrnil napako med preverjanjem ključa denarnice v aplikaciji SORA. Iz tega neuspešnega dejanja ni bilo sklenjeno, da ključ manjka.";
"The saved account and its recovery evidence did not agree. SORA preserved them and stopped before approving wallet access." = "Shranjeni račun in dokazila za njegovo obnovo se niso ujemali. SORA jih je ohranila in se ustavila pred odobritvijo dostopa do denarnice.";
"SORA could not verify the saved wallet database. Existing files and recovery copies have been preserved." = "SORA ni mogla preveriti shranjene podatkovne zbirke denarnice. Obstoječe datoteke in obnovitvene kopije so ohranjene.";
"SORA needs more free storage to retain a verified recovery copy before completing this upgrade." = "SORA potrebuje več prostega prostora za ohranitev preverjene obnovitvene kopije pred dokončanjem te nadgradnje.";
"SORA could not complete the latest wallet verification. The details below identify the failed check; existing wallet data has been preserved." = "SORA ni mogla dokončati zadnjega preverjanja denarnice. Spodnje podrobnosti določajo neuspešno preverjanje; obstoječi podatki denarnice so ohranjeni.";
"A wallet credential repair must finish before sending. Open Restore keys to retry the repair." = "Popravilo poverilnic denarnice se mora končati pred pošiljanjem. Odpri Obnovi ključe za ponovni poskus popravila.";
"Checking keys…" = "Preverjanje ključev…";
"Checking this account’s signing keys…" = "Preverjanje podpisnih ključev tega računa…";
"Keys repaired; wallet checks need attention" = "Ključi so popravljeni; preverjanja denarnice zahtevajo pozornost";
